505
00:35:13.822 --> 00:35:16.073
- It's not what I said.
- [Camille] No.

506
00:35:16.074 --> 00:35:19.535
No. of course not. I have to read
between the lines like always.

507
00:35:19.536 --> 00:35:21.455
