[breathing heavily] Hmm.

528
00:36:40.951 --> 00:36:43.078
- [Helen] Hmm?
- You. uhâ€¦ Umâ€¦

529
00:36:45.289 --> 00:36:46.539
Well. you kept the PEZ.

530
00:36:46.540 --> 00:36:48.249
Didn't even know I had it.

531
00:36:48.250 --> 00:36:49.668
- Really?
- [Helen] Mmm.

532
00:36:50.252 --> 00:36:52.420
- Wasn't a memento?
- No.

533
00:36:52.421 --> 00:36:56.048
Something to help you remember
the world's worst blind date?

534
00:36:56.049 --> 00:36:57.717
- It wasn't a date.
- [Daniel] Oh.

535
00:36:57.718 --> 00:36:58.802
Right.

536
00:37:02.347 --> 00:37:04.391
- [vehicle approaches]
- [siren blares]

537
00:37:06.935 --> 00:37:08.144
Shit.

538
00:37:08.145 --> 00:37:09.980
- Oh. my God.
- [Daniel] You were right.

539
00:37:10.731 --> 00:37:12.858
I honestly didn't think we had
a hope in hell.

540
00:37:28.540 --> 00:37:30.208
They're not stopping us.

541
00:37:30.209 --> 00:37:31.627
Because they don't want to.

542
00:37:33.670 --> 00:37:34.963
They're our escort.

543
00:37:45.432 --> 00:37:46.642
[keypad beeps]

544
