545
00:37:57.110 --> 00:37:58.320
Hello?

546
00:38:02.616 --> 00:38:03.617
You there?

547
00:38:06.662 --> 00:38:08.413
[The Algorithm] <i>What is a mistake?</i>

548
00:38:11.625 --> 00:38:15.671
[stammers] Allowing Juliette
to send someone to Silo 17.

549
00:38:16.171 --> 00:38:18.340
She's after more than the children.

550
