554
00:38:39.653 --> 00:38:41.864
[The Algorithm] <i>You're not
really interested in an answer.</i>

555
00:38:42.364 --> 00:38:44.032
<i>You are looking for an argument.</i>

556
00:38:44.700 --> 00:38:46.117
<i>I will not engage.</i>

557
00:38:46.118 --> 00:38:47.535
Fuck off.

558
00:38:47.536 --> 00:38:50.414
[The Algorithm] <i>Your heart rate
and respiration are elevated.</i>

559
00:38:50.914 --> 00:38:53.124
[scoffs] Okay.

560
00:38:53.125 --> 00:38:56.794
I feel Juliette is a threat to the Silo.

561
00:38:56.795 --> 00:39:00.965
My husband is lying to me.
and my son is a thief.

562
00:39:00.966 --> 00:39:02.216
All of thatâ€¦

563
00:39:02.217 --> 00:39:04.677
All of that is on me.

564
00:39:04.678 --> 00:39:08.432
[stammers] As head of IT.
as a wife. as a mother.

565
00:39:09.683 --> 00:39:10.726
Andâ€¦

566
00:39:14.146 --> 00:39:15.314
I'm failing.

567
00:39:18.775 --> 00:39:19.943
I'm failing.

568
00:39:23.197 --> 00:39:24.198
[clears throat]

569
00:39:27.701 --> 00:39:28.702
Fuck.

570
00:39:33.498 --> 00:39:35.542
[The Algorithm]
<i>I'm sorry you feel that way.</i>

571
00:39:37.085 --> 00:39:39.545
- <i>but thoughts aren't facts.</i>
- [sighs]

572
00:39:39.546 --> 00:39:43.550
<i>That sense of failure is the result
of being emotionally exhausted.</i>

573
00:39:45.511 --> 00:39:50.015
<i>You need to find a moment
for yourself. To reflect.</i>

574
00:39:51.350 --> 00:39:52.351
Yeah.

575
00:39:55.145 --> 00:39:56.146
[sighs]

576
00:40:00.234 --> 00:40:01.568
