[Hank] Nothing.

613
00:42:17.037 --> 00:42:18.497
[breathes heavily]

614
00:42:23.252 --> 00:42:25.170
Show us Supply at the same time.

615
00:42:31.051 --> 00:42:33.053
[stammers] No. Wait. Stop. What'sâ€¦

616
00:42:35.305 --> 00:42:36.348
Is that Glenda?

617
00:42:36.849 --> 00:42:39.058
- Wasn't she just in the mines?
- Is this at the same time?

618
00:42:39.059 --> 00:42:40.852
Yeah. the same ten minutes.

619
00:42:40.853 --> 00:42:43.355
How did Glenda get
from the mines to Supply in ten minutes?

620
00:42:44.690 --> 00:42:45.691
I don't know.

621
