That thing earlier with Billings?

640
00:44:21.870 --> 00:44:23.121
Kind of intense.

641
00:44:25.082 --> 00:44:27.376
Yeah. he's an asshole.

642
00:44:30.003 --> 00:44:32.381
I meant your reaction
when he mentioned your father.

643
00:44:34.091 --> 00:44:35.676
My father's an asshole too.

644
00:44:41.098 --> 00:44:42.432
So you gonna tell me?

645
00:44:47.354 --> 00:44:48.772
He was never around.

646
00:44:51.358 --> 00:44:53.277
I mean. maybe you'll remember growing upâ€¦

647
00:44:54.778 --> 00:44:56.405
it was just me and my mom.

648
00:44:58.907 --> 00:45:01.910
And it was hard. We struggled.

649
00:45:03.495 --> 00:45:05.037
Never enough food.

650
00:45:05.038 --> 00:45:07.749
I never hadâ€¦ [chuckles] â€¦clothes that fit.

651
00:45:09.626 --> 00:45:12.003
I remember when I was a little kid.

652
00:45:12.004 --> 00:45:17.009
I wanted one of those.
uhâ€¦ those Freedom Day lanterns.

653
00:45:17.509 --> 00:45:19.553
I wanted one so bad.

654
