Okay. [sighs. clears throat]

686
00:47:45.115 --> 00:47:47.783
You'll need to turn off
the osmosis filtration system

687
00:47:47.784 --> 00:47:49.119
before we add it.

688
00:47:51.079 --> 00:47:52.789
- Uh--
- Is there a problem?

689
00:48:09.264 --> 00:48:10.848
[Ed] Okay. shit-heels.

690
00:48:10.849 --> 00:48:12.391
Eyes on me.

691
