705
00:49:11.535 --> 00:49:13.370
He died two years ago.

706
00:49:17.666 --> 00:49:20.377
[keypad beeping]

707
00:49:30.554 --> 00:49:34.849
[The Algorithm] <i>Hello. Juliette Nichols.
have you chosen your candidates?</i>

708
00:49:34.850 --> 00:49:35.851
